  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7256b9bf-5840-5dce-8257-d3db1868efdb" activityNameId="7733239e-c17d-58e5-8b9a-a9dbf87ab1ec" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tin plating, pieces</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tin plating, pieces
The dataset can be applied for the tin plating process of steel, preferably of chromium steel (18/8). ;
UUID: 06bdff48-4869-3a2a-bea8-99998ef137cc
The dataset describes the tin plating process of chromium steel. Included processes are degreasing, electrolytic degreasing, pickling, stripping, fluxing and rinsing. The treatment of the resulting waste water is also inventoried, as well as the transportation of materials by a 32t lorry. The infrastructure is approximated with a steel rolling mill.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Tin plating of chromium steel sheet, including processes of tin plating and sheet rolling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature mainly 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that one galvanising company in Switzerland is representative for Central Europe, is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_06bdff48-4869-3a2a-bea8-99998ef137cc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
